  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Monitoring the Sustainable Development Goals</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">To improve the use and dissemination of the Sustainable Development Goal indicators at national and international levels in order to enable governments, researchers, international organisations and civil society to make evidence-based decisions. This project will focus on supporting developing countries to build their capacity in disseminating data; modernising National Statistical Systems with up-to-date technology and skills; engaging with key users of data; and creating an on-line, international data and visualisation platform for Sustainable Development Goal indicators.</narrative>
  </description>
